# Merrow Skyswimmer (a 2/2 flying vigilance Merfolk with convoke): "When this creature enters, create a 1/1 white and blue Merfolk
# creature token." Bot1 casts three Ornithopters for nothing and then the Skyswimmer for {3}{W/U}{W/U}: the three Ornithopters
# are tapped for the generic {3}, Mox Pearl and Mox Sapphire pay the two hybrid symbols. The Merfolk token arrives 1/1, white
# and blue. On turn 3 the Skyswimmer attacks and, with vigilance, stays untapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Merrow Skyswimmer
Plains
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

